        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tackle Box</i>, you play as John Tacklebox – a grizzled fisherman, quiet and stubborn as the sea itself. <br>Your village has emptied over the years, leaving you alone with your memories, your rod, and the ocean.<br>But when you enter a legendary fishing competition, the fight for survival begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISHING MEETS FIGHTING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch bigger fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat until your arms fall off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIGHT, SIMPLE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch. Dodge. Block. Slam fish into the dirt.<br>The controls are easy to learn and satisfying every time you land a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOSS FISH WITH ATTITUDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a lineup of over-the-top fighters, each with their own moves and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has unique mechanics and a desire to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has quotes guaranteed to make you question buying this game:<br><strong></strong><br><strong>“YOU WILL BE FISHED.”</strong><br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, CATCH, BRAWL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through lakes, rivers, and oceans to find new fish to fight and new ways to get beaten up by wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're the best angler in the valley? Prove it.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tackle Box</i>, you play as John Tacklebox – a grizzled fisherman, quiet and stubborn as the sea itself. <br>Your village has emptied over the years, leaving you alone with your memories, your rod, and the ocean.<br>But when you enter a legendary fishing competition, the fight for survival begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISHING MEETS FIGHTING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch bigger fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat until your arms fall off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIGHT, SIMPLE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch. Dodge. Block. Slam fish into the dirt.<br>The controls are easy to learn and satisfying every time you land a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOSS FISH WITH ATTITUDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a lineup of over-the-top fighters, each with their own moves and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has unique mechanics and a desire to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has quotes guaranteed to make you question buying this game:<br><strong></strong><br><strong>“YOU WILL BE FISHED.”</strong><br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, CATCH, BRAWL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through lakes, rivers, and oceans to find new fish to fight and new ways to get beaten up by wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're the best angler in the valley? Prove it.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Tackle Box is a fast-paced fishing and fighting game where every catch wants to beat you up and drag you into the lake before you smack it with a rod. Cast your line, and get ready to throw hands with aquatic wildlife that absolutely did not evolve for peaceful coexistence.",
